[I] Tool to rotate logfiles

[T] logrotate is designed to simplify the administration of log files on
[T] systems which generate a lot of them. It allows the automatic rotation,
[T] compression, removal and mailing of log files, handled daily, weekly,
[T] monthly or when they grow too large, usually run from cron.

[U] https://github.com/logrotate/logrotate

[A] Logrotate Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

